      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "695175dbea82f9b1",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Chanhee Cho 及另外 2 位作者撰写的论文《步长为 k 的子采样：面向 Whisper 的免训练音频词元缩减》的 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
